  "id": "northern-italian-beef-stew",
  "name": "Northern Italian Beef Stew",
  "subtitle": "Slow-simmered beef with vegetables, herbs, and red wine",
  "description": "Lean beef, mushrooms, tomatoes, potatoes, and root vegetables simmer with wine, stock, and herbs until tender.",
